<?php
return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:51+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:51+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'适用于任何 WordPress 网站的页面缓存和 Redis 对象缓存。在有 LiteSpeed 服务器缓存的地方使用它，在其他地方使用自身的磁盘缓存，仅清理受更改影响的部分，并验证其 Redis 连接是否正常工作。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'缓存','Page cache'=>'页面缓存','Object cache'=>'对象缓存','Purging'=>'正在清除','Exclusions'=>'排除项','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI 代理 (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'立即清除所有缓存','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'每一个已缓存的页面都将被丢弃，并在访客访问时重新生成。是否继续？','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'允许 AI 代理 (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'关闭：以下工具及其 REST 路由完全未注册。','Full-page cache'=>'全页缓存','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'在 LiteSpeed 服务器上，页面在 WordPress 运行之前由网页服务器提供。在任何其他服务器上，此插件将每个页面存储为文件，并在 WordPress 加载之前提供。这就是几乎所有速度的来源。','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'为未登录的访客缓存页面','How long a page stays cached'=>'页面保持缓存的时长','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'秒。一周适合大多数网站；每小时发布一次的新闻网站需要的时间要短得多。','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'访客浏览器保留图像和脚本的时长','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'秒。仅适用于图片、CSS 和 JavaScript — 绝不适用于网页。设置为 0 则由您的主机决定。','Signed-in visitors'=>'已登录访客','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'切勿向已登录的访客提供缓存页面','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'“开启”是安全且默认的选项。仅当您确定每个已登录用户的每个缓存页面都完全相同时才将其关闭——会员网站通常是禁用的原因。','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'不同内容采用不同生命周期','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'例如：商店的产品页面保存一小时，而其他所有内容保存一周。','Add a rule'=>'添加规则','Content type'=>'内容类型','Seconds'=>'秒','Object cache (Redis)'=>'对象缓存（Redis）','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'您的主机已为本网站运行专用的 Redis 对象缓存并保持配置状态。这里无需进行任何设置；此屏幕顶部的状态显示其是否正在工作。','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'缓存数据库查询结果。对于流量巨大的店铺或有大量登录访问者的网站（这是页面缓存无法做到的情况），此功能的作用最为显著。','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'安装 Redis 对象缓存插件','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'需要 phpredis 扩展。如果缺少该扩展，此屏幕上方的方框中将会显示提示。','Redis host'=>'Redis 主机','Redis port'=>'Redis 端口','Redis database'=>'Redis 数据库','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'为共享 Redis 上的每个站点分配各自的编号，否则它们会互相清除缓存。','Redis username'=>'Redis 用户名','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'仅适用于配置了 ACL 用户的 Redis 服务器（Redis 6 或更高版本）。留空则仅使用密码登录。','Redis password'=>'Redis 密码','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'若您的 Redis 不需要，请留空。','Key prefix'=>'密钥前缀','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'当您无法拥有独立数据库编号时的一种替代方案。','Smart auto-purge'=>'智能自动清除','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'内容更改时自动清除受影响的页面','After updates'=>'更新后','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'在核心、插件或主题更新后清除所有内容','After a comment'=>'评论后','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'当博文的评论通过审核时清除该博文的页面缓存','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'在评论区非常活跃、每小时可能清理同一页面数百次的情况下关闭此功能。','Never cache these'=>'永不缓存这些','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'始终应用合理的 WordPress 和 WooCommerce 默认设置——无论下方的内容如何，购物车、结账、我的账户以及任何已登录的会话都不会被缓存。','Addresses'=>'地址','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'每行一个路径，例如 <code>/basket</code>。结尾的 <code>*</code> 会匹配其下的所有内容。','Query parameters'=>'查询参数','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'带有此类标记的页面永远不会被缓存——例如一次性预览令牌。','Cookies'=>'Cookie','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'携带其中一个的访客始终会收到全新的页面。','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'所有已缓存的页面均已被清除。它们将随着访问者的到来而重新生成。','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'对象缓存已安装，但未存储任何内容。','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'页面缓存已开启，但页面尚未被存储。','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress 尚未加载页面缓存插件。它将在下一次页面加载时启动；如果未启动，请检查 wp-config.php 中 WP_CACHE 是否为 true。','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'对象缓存已启用，但此服务器不支持 Redis。','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'未安装 phpredis 扩展，因此无法使用直插式缓存，WordPress 将退回到其自身的内存缓存。请联系您的主机商启用 phpredis。','Nothing is being cached.'=>'没有内容被缓存。','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'两个缓存都已关闭，因此该插件并没有让网站变快。','Caching is active on this site.'=>'本网站已启用了缓存。','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis 拒绝了用户名或密码。请检查 wp-config.php 中或此屏幕上的 Redis 凭据。','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis 接受了登录，但不允许此站点存储其键。Redis 用户需要此站点键前缀的权限。','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis 拒绝了该数据库编号。请检查 Redis 数据库设置。','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis 内存已满，正在拒绝新数据。','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'phpredis 扩展未安装，因此 WordPress 正在使用其自身的内存缓存。请联系您的主机提供商启用 phpredis。','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'wp-config.php 中已设置 WP_REDIS_DISABLED，因此对象缓存已关闭。','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'无法连接到 Redis 服务器。请检查 Redis 主机和端口，并确保 Redis 正在运行。','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis 未能返回刚刚写入的值。请检查 Redis 服务器的日志。','Web server'=>'Web 服务器','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — 网页由 Web 服务器缓存','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'不是 LiteSpeed — 此外挂程式将页面快取在磁碟上','Pages stored on disk'=>'磁盘存储的页面','Redis support'=>'Redis 支持','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis 已安装','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis 未安装','Page lifetime'=>'页面生命周期','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'您无权清除缓存。','Cache purge requested.'=>'已请求清除缓存。','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® 缓存：已安装另一个对象缓存替代程序，因此 Redis 对象缓存不由该插件管理。','detected'=>'已检测到','not detected'=>'未检测到','phpredis extension missing'=>'缺少 phpredis 扩展','installed, not storing anything'=>'已安装，未存储任何内容','active, managed by your host'=>'活跃，由您的主机管理','active'=>'已启用','inactive'=>'未启用','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed 缓存：','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis 对象缓存：','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'此服务器上未提供 Redis PHP 扩展（phpredis），因此无法启用对象缓存。','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'另一个对象缓存插件已安装。请在启用 Zinn® 对象缓存之前将其移除。','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'无法写入 Redis 连接配置文件。','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'无法读取捆绑的对象缓存 drop-in。','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'无法将对象缓存 drop-in 安装到 wp-content 中。','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'无法移除对象缓存 drop-in。','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress 文件系统不可写入，因此无法管理对象缓存 drop-in。','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'另一个页面缓存插件已安装 wp-content/advanced-cache.php。请先卸载该插件，或者继续使用其页面缓存。','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'无法写入文件夹 wp-content/cache/zinn-cache，因此无法缓存页面。','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'无法写入 wp-content/advanced-cache.php，因此无法缓存页面。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供该更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以连接到 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务 (%s) 下载更新。请几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性校验，未能安装。','Go Pro'=>'升级专业版','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'缓存分析屏幕：命中率、内存、键以及最慢的缓存命令。','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'一个能够识别出导致该问题的插件或主题的慢查询和未缓存调用查找器。','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'在 Redis 前端为最热键配备内存 APCu 层，并支持预取、压缩和 igbinary 序列化程序。','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'基于标签的文章、分类法和 WooCommerce 产品清理，仅清理已更改的内容，并同时清理页面缓存和对象缓存。','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'清除缓存后的自动预热、WebP 与 AVIF 图片、未使用 CSS 的移除以及延迟加载 JavaScript。','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'定时数据库清理及预览，以及按页面的缓存规则。','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'当命中率下降或内存占满时，您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板中会显示缓存健康警报。','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'其他选项卡中的所有内容都是免费的，并将保持免费。Pro 版在此插件的基础上安装并增加了以下功能：','See what Pro costs'=>'查看 Pro 版价格','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'每个方案均可享受14天免费试用，无需绑定银行卡：单站点每年 %1$s，五个站点 %2$s，无限站点 %3$s。','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'未找到 wp-config.php，因此无法开启 WP_CACHE。请在其中添加 define( \'WP_CACHE\', true );。','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php 已经将 WP_CACHE 定义为 false，因此页面缓存无法启动。请将其更改为 true。','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php 不可写，因此无法开启 WP_CACHE。请在其中添加 define( \'WP_CACHE\', true );。','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请