s been successfully started.'=>'您的试用已成功开始。','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'您以前已经使用过试用版。','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'您对目前使用的 %1$s 感觉如何？通过 %3$d 天免费试用体验我们所有的 %2$s 高级功能。','Type'=>'类型','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'无法连接到文件系统。请确认您的凭据。','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'处理您的请求时发生了意外的 API 错误。请在几分钟后重试。如果仍然无法正常工作，请将以下内容发送给 %s 的作者：','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'发生意外错误，请在5分钟后重试。如果错误仍然存在，请联系客服。','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'卸载 %s 会自动停用该许可证，您可以在其他网站上使用它。','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'发生未知错误。','Unlimited commissions.'=>'无限佣金。','Unlimited Updates'=>'无限更新','verbUpdate'=>'更新','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'您要继续进行更新吗？','Update'=>'更新','Update License'=>'更新许可证','Upgrade'=>'升级','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'重要升级通知：','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'上传并激活已下载的版本','User Dashboard'=>'用户仪表盘','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'抱歉，我们无法完成电子邮箱的更新。已有其他用户使用相同的电子邮箱注册。','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'如果您想将 %1$s 账户的所有权转交给 %2$s，请点击“更改所有权”按钮。','User ID'=>'用户 ID','User key'=>'用户密钥','Users'=>'用户','Value'=>'值','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'验证邮件已发送至 %s。如果 5 分钟后仍未找到，请检查您的垃圾邮件箱。','Verified'=>'已验证','Verify Email'=>'验证电子邮件','product versionVersion'=>'版本','Version %s was released.'=>'版本 %s 已发布。','View details'=>'查看详情','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'点击查看完整尺寸截图 %d','View paid features'=>'查看付费功能','Warning'=>'警告','What is your %s?'=>'您的%