ncompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'分享诊断数据有助于提供与您的网站相关的附加功能，避免破坏网站的 WordPress 或 PHP 版本不兼容问题，并识别 %s 应该翻译和定制到哪些语言和地区。','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'这样，当 %s 不再处于活动状态时，您就可以重复使用该许可证。','Subscription'=>'订阅','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s 将定期向 %2$s 发送必要的许可数据，以检查安全和功能更新，并验证您的许可证的有效性。','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'有 %1$s 的 %2$s 可用。','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'为了确保兼容性并避免与您已安装的插件和主题发生冲突。','Trial'=>'试用','View %s State'=>'查看 %s 状态','View Basic %s Info'=>'查看基本 %s 信息','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'是，就测试、预演或开发而言，%2$s 是 %4$s 的重复项。','You have a %s license.'=>'您拥有 %s 许可证。','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'您已购买一份 %s 许可证。','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'您应该会在 %2$s 的收件箱中收到关于 %1$s 的确认邮件。请务必点击该邮件中的按钮以 %3$s。','days'=>'天数','deactivating'=>'正在停用','hour'=>'小时','hours'=>'小时','license'=>'许可证','optional'=>'可选','products'=>'产品','skip'=>'跳过','subscription'=>'订阅','trial'=>'试用','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'产品','as activating pluginActivating'=>'正在激活','as software licenseLicense'=>'许可证','close a windowDismiss'=>'忽略','close windowDismiss'=>'忽略','like websitesSites'=>'站点','nounPricing'=>'定价','trial periodTrial'=>'试用','verbOpt In'=>'启用','verbOpt Out'=>'退出','verbSkip'=>'跳过','verbUpgrade'=>'升级','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s前','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'操作无法完成。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请联系网站管理员。','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或格式错误。请检查该功能的数据输入模式。','The site refused the request.'=>'网站拒绝了该请求。','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'让 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）为您在此网站上工作。它们会以 WordPress 用户的身份使用应用程序密码登录，并且只能执行该用户被允许执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 智能体需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建应用密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'请将此内容添加到您的 AI 应用的 MCP 设置中，并输入您的用户名和该密码：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：请将相同的条目放在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下方，而不是 "mcpServers" 下方。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'AI 代理在此处可使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：功能、REST 和 MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'使用 Zinn® Cache 检查并清理此站点的缓存，并更改其缓存设置。','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'页面和对象缓存状态、清理及设置。','Read the cache status'=>'读取缓存状态','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'返回页面缓存和对象缓存是否已开启并正常工作、已缓存的页面数量，以及对象缓存的连接数和命中数。','Read the cache settings'=>'读取缓存设置','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'返回所有缓存设置。绝不会返回 Redis 密码，仅返回是否已保存密码。','Change the cache settings'=>'更改缓存设置','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'更改您发送的设置并保留其余部分（页面缓存、页面缓存保留时间、对象缓存及其 Redis 连接、清理规则和排除项）。系统会像在“缓存”屏幕上一样对值进行检查和修正。','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'将缓存设置恢复为默认值','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'将所有缓存设置恢复为默认值，重置按钮的功能也是如此。保存的 Redis 密码也将被删除。','Read the diagnostics report'=>'阅读诊断报告','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'返回支持人员请求的诊断报告：版本、服务器限制、缓存状态和近期错误。其中不包含任何密码或密钥。','Purge the cache'=>'清理缓存','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'丢弃缓存的页面：全部（all: true）、部分地址（urls）或所有带标签的页面（tags）。页面将在访客访问时重新生成。']];